# Opening lead style (`## 1. Lời mở đầu` / `## 1. Opening`)

For module 4 lessons, keep the opening bridge paragraph high-level and conceptual.

## Preferred Vietnamese lead

Prefer this shape:

`Bài này dẫn qua hai mạch liên tiếp. Phần 2.1 là thực hành đồng bộ với repository trên GitHub; ... Phần 2.2 làm rõ/củng cố lý thuyết ...`

Keep the emphasis on:

- practical track intent (stack + verification outcomes),
- theory track intent (concepts + edge cases),
- learner outcome.

## Preferred English lead

Use a parallel shape:

`This lesson proceeds in two connected tracks. Part 2.1 is hands-on and aligned with the GitHub repository; ... Part 2.2 clarifies/reinforces the theory ...`

## Do not in the opening lead

- Do not start with phrasing like **“Bài này chạy hai nhịp liên tiếp giống các bài khác trong module …”**.
- Do not embed implementation path details such as exact folder paths (for example **`.../.docker`**) in the opening lead.
- Do not overload opening lead with endpoint-by-endpoint execution steps; move those to hands-on subsections.
